1
00:00:00,608 --> 00:00:02,778
We pawned them, dude. Up top.

2
00:00:02,944 --> 00:00:04,114
(Sheldon:)Look at him.

3
00:00:04,946 --> 00:00:08,116
(Sheldon:)Wil Wheaton, my old friend.

4
00:00:08,282 --> 00:00:10,782
(Sheldon:)I have chased you
around the moons of Nibia...

5
00:00:10,952 --> 00:00:15,412
...and around the Antares Maelstrom,
and around Perdition's flames.

6
00:00:15,790 --> 00:00:18,790
(Raj:)You keep quoting Wrath of Khan,
but he was in Next Generation.

7
00:00:18,960 --> 00:00:22,460
(Raj:)-It's a totally different set of characters.
-Silence.

8
00:00:23,464 --> 00:00:26,174
(Sheldon:)How much longer must I wait
for my revenge?

9
00:00:26,342 --> 00:00:28,472
(Raj:)If Wil Wheaton
and Stuart win their match...

10
00:00:28,636 --> 00:00:32,306
(Raj:)...and we beat Lonely Larry and
Captain Sweatpants in the next round...

11
00:00:32,598 --> 00:00:34,268
...we'll face off for championship.

12
00:00:34,434 --> 00:00:41,024
(Sheldon:)So my path to satisfaction is blocked
by Lonely Larry and Captain Sweatpants.

13
00:00:42,442 --> 00:00:45,822
(Sheldon:)Very well, they must be destroyed.

14
00:00:45,987 --> 00:00:48,827
(Raj:)Dude, you have to stop talking like that.
It's really lame.

15
00:00:48,990 --> 00:00:56,020
(Sheldon:)Silence.

